        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Sistine Chapel ceiling</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1508 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Made by</span><span class="info-stat-val">Painted by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/michelangelo">Michelangelo</a>, a sculptor by training, at the commission of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pope-julius-ii">Pope Julius II</a>, with theological advice that is debated and scaffolding built by Piero Roselli</span></div>
